<ttl id="1002J_S000U_744TG_T0089" variety="T0089">
<name>ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA System</name>
<para id="RM000000NEP00FX" category="C" type-id="302TW" name-id="442OS-00" from="200612" to="200810">
<dtccode>C1380/64</dtccode>
<dtcname>Stop Light Drive Relay System Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000000NEP00FX_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00004I500000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>During hill-start assist control, the skid control computer operates the BRAKE LP relay to illuminate the stop lights.</ptxt>
<ptxt>If a stop light switch open circuit code (C1249/49) is output, perform troubleshooting for the stop light switch circuit open.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.22in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.86in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1380/64</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>With the IG1 terminal voltage at 11to14V, a condition in which there is no input signal to the STP terminal when the stop light control relay drive output (STP0) is ON continues for 2 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>With the IG1 terminal voltage at 11to14V, a condition in which the input signals of the STP and STP2 terminals differ when the stop light control relay drive output (STP0) is OFF continues for 5 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>STOP Fuse</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>BRAKE LP Relay</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Stop Light Switch Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Stop light switch wire harness open or short circuit</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Poor contact pressure, terminal deformation or corrosion of connector</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Actuator ground open circuit</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Actuator assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000NEP00FX_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00004I600000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
