</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000NEP00FX_03" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000NEP00FX_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00004I700000">
<testtitle>Inspect Fuse (STOP 10A)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of the fuse (STOP 10A).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>STOP Fuse</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0005" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0011" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___00004I900000">
<testtitle>Inspect BRAKE LP Relay</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Remove the BRAKE LP relay from the engine room relay block.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the relay case and terminals are not deformed or corroded.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No deformation or corrosion</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each terminal of the relay.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C116660" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="0.94in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1(RLY-) - 2(RLY+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="2" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Approximately 111 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>5(ST+) - 3(STPL)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>4(STP) - 3(STPL)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>5(ST+) - 3(STPL)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>When battery voltage is applied between terminals 1 (RLY-) and 2 (RLY+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0006" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0012" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0006" proc-id="RM0550J___00004IA00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness (Engine Room Relay Block - Battery)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between the engine room relay block and body ground.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C160326J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.96in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.98in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.19in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>2 (RLY+) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>8 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>5 (ST+) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>8 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0007" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0008" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0007" proc-id="RM0550J___00004IB00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness (Engine Room Relay Block - Actuator Assembly)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the actuator assembly connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the connector case and terminals are not deformed or corroded.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No deformation or corrosion</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of the wire harness side connectors between the engine room relay block and actuator assembly.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C158877J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.96in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.17in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1(RLY-) - 31(STP0)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="2" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="2" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>3(STPL) - 2(STP)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>4(STP) - 22(STP2)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the engine room relay block and body ground.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.97in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.97in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.19in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 (RLY-) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="2" valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="2" valign="middle">
<ptxt> 10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>3 (STPL) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>4 (STP) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0008" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___00004I800000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000060000PX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Without operating the brake pedal, turn ON the stop light drive relay using the Active Test, wait for 2 seconds or more, and check for DTC output. (see <xref label="Seep03" href="RM000000602011X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Stop light drive relay malfunction DTC is not output</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>While the stop light drive relay is OFF, depress and hold the brake pedal for 5 seconds, release the brake pedal and wait for 5 seconds, then check the DTCs again. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM00000060000PX"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Stop light drive relay malfunction DTC is not output</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" align="center" colwidth="2.78in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" align="center" colwidth="1.35in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="left">
<ptxt>Stop light drive relay system malfunction code is output again by relay operation</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="left">
<ptxt>Stop light drive relay system malfunction code is output again by brake pedal operation</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0004" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0015" fin="true">B</right>
<right ref="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0018" fin="false">C</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000NEP00FX_04_0004">
<testtitle>Perform Problem Reproduction Test<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
